  "kind": "special",
  "description": "Fuselage: Colorado flag: dark blue crown and dark blue belly, white band through the window line, nose dark blue; a huge red 'C' encircling a gold/yellow disc on the forward fuselage just behind the cockpit door. Cheatlines: White middle band between blue top and bottom, running full length. Tail: Heart fin with white 'Southwest'. Engines: Dark blue cowlings. Winglets: approximate: gray/white. Titles: 'Southwest' white on lower fin; 'Colorado One' small by cockpit. Artwork: Colorado flag 'C' and gold disc. Colors hex: approximate.",
